		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Dimlite，一个 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>皮革腰带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、dimlite 金块和一块黑曜石。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>第一条真正的腰带，也是</grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>小行星带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的基础。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "1073E8F3DDF337F7"
			tasks: [{
				id: "576828A0058B5548"
				item: "terramity:anti_gravity_belt"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -1.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>围绕着一个 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>反重力腰带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和一个 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>重击腰带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的宇宙石。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>两条带子输入，一条带子输出，之后就会变成</grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>柯伊伯带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。这个笑话分三个阶段完成。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0C0DDB3F8F45EF60"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6FB1447CC42A5254"
				item: "terramity:asteroid_belt"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -2.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Prismatic Sarashi</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、虚空合金和一颗 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Asteroid Belt</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>太空带线路的终点。投入了三个带子和一条sarashi。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "501385DA70AC1D47"
			tasks: [{
				id: "5E23CE29AC25F869"
				item: "terramity:kuiper_belt"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -0.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可在试炼尖塔、雪堡垒和可疑祭坛的宝箱中找到。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>普通版，以及棱镜版和反向版的基础版。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "0ADD9EBFE9F1A1E2"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4E40622E67228E2C"
				item: "terramity:sarashi"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.5d
			y: 2.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>火药、托帕石、一条 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>皮革腰带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和水桶。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与闪烁腰带和忍带并列，能让你摆脱困境的三种腰带之一。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "5EA44444BDBA9CEE"
			tasks: [{
				id: "6631741DFE89022F"
				item: "terramity:hurricane_belt"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -3.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可在试炼尖塔、雪堡垒和可疑祭坛的宝箱中找到。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Blink Belt</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的基础，而它又是后面两条腰带的基底。见到就都拿上吧。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "659843631320710D"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4CA9C588FB26447F"
				item: "terramity:shinobi_sash"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>红宝石、发酵蜘蛛眼和地狱合金围绕着一条 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>闪烁腰带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>“献祭”这个词并非只是装饰。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "71561BD79691330C"
			tasks: [{
				id: "460A767711185756"
				item: "terramity:sacrificial_sash"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 1.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Shinobi Sash</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 周围放置了爆开的紫颂果和虚空合金。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>虚空合金意味着暗物质，也就意味着试炼守卫已经死亡了。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它是 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Sacrificial Sash</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Shadowflame Sash</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的基础。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "540B410226A6599C"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1FBA5E2C3CD0AFCE"
				item: "terramity:blink_belt"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 2.5d
			y: 4.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在闪烁腰带周围放置爆开的紫颂果、幽灵灵魂和夜光石。</grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Shadowflame</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 无视火焰抗性，也无视水，完全没有任何反制手段。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Nyxium 的意思是月亮已经被射击了。</grad></shadow>"
