				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>来自矮人王戈布的掉落物，</grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>生命值1350的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>首个首领怪。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在侏儒庭院中，用红侏儒帽右键点击金侏儒雕像即可召唤他。</grad></shadow>"
