			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一颗棱镜宝石和围绕着一颗 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>Sarashi</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的虹彩碎片。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它为 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>柯伊伯带</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>提供养分，所以这既是垫脚石，也是一条腰带。</grad></shadow>"
			]
			id: "58F9EBC7FC71DC11"
