			x: 1.5d
			y: 7.0d
		}
		{
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>虚空合金和围绕普通羊毛的线 </grad><grad from=#2FB8B0 to=#A8F0EA f=0.8>纱织布</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>四张sarashi中唯一与众不同的那张，也是唯一想要终局合金的那张。</grad></shadow>"
